OL,4,BTwo goals in 15 games - what's going   
OL,5,Bon with Gyokeres?                      
OL,6,GA Premier League trophy and 21 goals   
OL,7,Gin his debut season - on paper things  
OL,8,Ghave worked out perfectly for Viktor   
OL,9,GGyokeres since his #64m transfer to    
OL,10,GArsenal.                               
OL,12,FBut, even with those achievements, it  
OL,13,Fhas been a tough start to the current  
OL,14,Fcampaign for the 28-year-old striker.  
OL,16,FThe Swede has started just one Premier 
OL,17,FLeague game this season and is yet to  
OL,18,Fscore in his eight league appearances. 
